[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16981.83, "timestamp": "04:43:01", "text": "你这么容易上当受骗，你到底想干什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16985.35, "timestamp": "04:43:05", "text": "容易上当受骗？为什么它又符合条件了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16988.31, "timestamp": "04:43:08", "text": "galible 到底是什么意思？就像谁？如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16990.31, "timestamp": "04:43:10", "text": "我跟你说件事。如果我告诉你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16993.35, "timestamp": "04:43:13", "text": "椰子小队来了，你肯定会相信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16995.03, "timestamp": "04:43:15", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16998.31, "timestamp": "04:43:18", "text": "等等，这也太容易上当受骗了吧。等等，什么？好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16999.99, "timestamp": "04:43:19", "text": "对不起。我应该……我应该更容易些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17003.91, "timestamp": "04:43:23", "text": "例子。如果我说，如果你有一天打成平手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17006.628, "timestamp": "04:43:26", "text": "我走到你面前，说：“你不能……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17010.708, "timestamp": "04:43:30", "text": "系好鞋带，因为系鞋带是不吉利的。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17012.708, "timestamp": "04:43:32", "text": "可能就是这样，你说就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17015.75, "timestamp": "04:43:35", "text": "好吧，你也不系鞋带。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17019.94, "timestamp": "04:43:39", "text": "我想，这大概就是太容易上当受骗了吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17022.55, "timestamp": "04:43:42", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17024.948, "timestamp": "04:43:44", "text": "你知道，或者如果我告诉你一些事"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17027.008, "timestamp": "04:43:47", "author": "@site36.official", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Oc0kgq4lSUaD-BoDbaDE3pXUquuz47c4Yh7kwPILHO2D70EQ5EnEgoGgTbb5gw993EEXRqCx_A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "The kokonut nut is a giant nut, if you eat to much you get very fat... it reminds me of the Kokonut song "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17027.35, "timestamp": "04:43:47", "text": "比如，“哦，是啊。我曾经和老虎搏斗过。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17031.75, "timestamp": "04:43:51", "text": "“你知道吗，我曾经和一个250磅重的家伙打过架。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17039.19, "timestamp": "04:43:59", "text": "椰子是一种巨大的坚果。如果你"}]